=========================Deployment===============
1. SSH into AWS EC2 and clone the git repos 
2. Create /data/db and /data/sunbeam/ml
3. Change permissions to 777 on ml 
4. Run ./start.sh inside sunbeamJS/sunbeam-app 
5. Run ./start.sh inside sunbeam flask directory 
6. Make sure the containers don't die when ssh terminates